Explain this:-
1 node(s) had untolerated taint(s) — almost certainly your control-plane node carrying node-role.kubernetes.io/control-plane:NoSchedule.
2 Insufficient cpu — the two workers don't have enough unrequested CPU left. This is about resources.requests.cpu arithmetic,
not actual utilization: the scheduler sums the CPU requests of all pods already bound to a node and compares the remainder against your pod's request.

